# Local working documentation and agent skills (not part of the published project).
# The workflow rules an agent actually needs (commit format, pull request, merge and
# release procedure) are duplicated in full inside `agents.md` and `claude.md`, which
# are tracked: nothing here is required to clone, build or contribute to the project.
.docs/

# Editor and local tooling folders (not part of the published project).
# `.github/` is tracked on purpose: the ci workflows and the dependency policy
# (dependabot.yml) only take effect if they are published with the repository.
